an class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うすぐらい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">昏暗；阴暗</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">薄める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うすめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">稀释；冲淡；变淡；减弱（如颜色、味道、浓度等）；缓和；削弱；淡化；调和（如言辞、印象、效果等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">群</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>群；聚集；人群；兽群；簇</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">グン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">む.れる・む.れ・むら・むら.がる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">群れ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">むれ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">群；群体；人群；羊群；兽群；鱼群；鸟群；蜂群；星团；丛集；群落</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">群</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぐん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">群；一群；一批；群体；（鱼的）鱼群；（鸟的）鸟群；（兽的）兽群；〔数〕群</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">群集</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぐんしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">群集；群体；社群；聚集；集合</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">秒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>秒（时间单位）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ビョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">秒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">秒（时间单位）；角秒；弧秒</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">奥</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>深处；内部；尽头；内心；深奥</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おく・おく.まる・くま</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">奥さん</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おくさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妻子；夫人；太太；贵夫人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">奥</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">内部；内里；深处；隐处；心底；尽头；（房屋后部的）居住区；内室；后室；心底；内心深处；言外之意；（技艺的）奥妙</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">詰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>塞满；堵塞；缩短；责备；最后阶段</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キツ・キチ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.める・つ.め・-づ.め・つ.まる・つ.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">詰める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">塞入；填充；堵住；塞满；缩短；靠拢；节省；节约开支；集中精力；竭力；拼尽全力；彻底处理；细致推敲；完成；收尾；值班；驻守；将（对手）逼入绝境；困死（将棋中的王将）；将死；切断（手指以示道歉）；夹住（手指等）；不间断地做；持续不停地做；彻底地做；完全地做；通过……将某人逼入困境</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">缶詰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんづめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">罐头食品；罐装食品；禁闭某人（如使其专心工作等）；被困在狭小空间内</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">瓶詰</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びんづめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">装瓶；瓶装；瓶装的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">双</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>一对；双方；两个；匹敌；量词（成对物）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふた・たぐい・ならぶ・ふたつ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\