</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">単純</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんじゅん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">简单；朴素；不复杂；直率；头脑简单；天真</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">純情</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纯情；天真；纯真无邪</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">純粋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纯粹；真正；真实；纯正</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">翌</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>下一个；次（日、年等）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">快</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>愉快；舒适；爽快；畅快</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こころよ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">快適</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいてき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">舒适；愉快；宜人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">愉快</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">愉快；令人高兴的；令人愉悦的；欢乐的；开心的；有趣的；高兴的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">快晴</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晴朗；万里无云；好天气</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">片</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\"