储存；积攒；存放；蓄须</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.める・たくわ.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯金</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょきん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">存钱；储蓄；存款；（棒球）胜场多于负场的场数差；胜负差盈余</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯蔵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贮存；保存；储备；囤积；囤积（不用于生产的商品或金钱）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯蓄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょちく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">储蓄；储钱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">硬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>硬；僵硬</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かた.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">硬い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">硬；坚硬；结实；僵硬；生硬；不流畅；不自然（如文章）；强；稳固；不易动摇；安全；稳妥；诚实；可靠；固执；顽固；书面化；正式；古板；拘谨</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">硬貨</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">硬币；钱币；硬通货</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">強硬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">坚定；强硬；不屈不挠；坚定不移；毫不妥协；固执；强硬的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">埋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>埋藏；填满；埋没；埋入</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.める・う.まる・う.もれる・うず.める・うず.まる・い.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">埋める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">埋葬；埋入地下；填满；使（观众等）坐满；堵住；填补（空隙）；弥补（差距）；补充（空缺职位）；填写（表格）；弥补；赔偿；补偿；注冷水（洗澡）；覆盖；撒覆</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">埋蔵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まいぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">埋藏；埋入地下；蕴藏；地下蕴藏</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">埋まる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うずまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">被埋；被覆盖；被包围；拥挤；充满；被偿还；被补足；被填补；被填满；（日程等）被排满</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">柱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>柱子；支柱；圆柱；支撑物</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はしら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">電柱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">でんちゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">电线杆；电力杆；电话杆；电报杆</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">柱</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はしら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">柱子；立柱；支柱；支撑物；支柱；中坚；（计数佛、神、贵族等的量词）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">祭</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>祭祀；供奉；庆祝；神化；崇拜</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まつ.る・まつ.り・まつり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お祭り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おまつり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">节日；庆典；狂欢节；祭典</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">祭</span><span class=\"ka